                <pb facs="0444" n="433" sameAs="frus:frus1937v02/pg433"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">211.68/158: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Shantz</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-09-29T17:00:00-05:00">September 29, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>36. Your 63, September 2, 2 p.m. In view of signing of protocol you should, if
                    you have not already done so, withdraw notice of abrogation given pursuant to
                    Department’s 55, November 4, 1933, 11 a.m.<anchor n="22" xml:id="d322-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
